  m_text: "- <color=red><b>Kh\xE1i ni\u1EC7m:</b> </color>Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng ph\xE2n
    c\u1EF1c l\xE0 tr\u01B0\u1EDDng \u0111i\u1EC7n t\u1EEB v\u1EDBi c\xE1c vect\u01A1
    E<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup>v\xE0 H<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup>bi\u1EBFn
    \u0111\u1ED5i c\xF3 t\xEDnh qui lu\u1EADt (X\xE1c \u0111\u1ECBnh \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c
    h\u01B0\u1EDBng v\xE0 \u0111\u1ED9 l\u1EDBn t\u1EA1i th\u1EDDi \u0111i\u1EC3m
    b\u1EA5t k\xEC)\r\n        + Ng\u01B0\u1EE3c l\u1EA1i: Tr\u01B0\u1EDDng kh\xF4ng
    ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c bi\u1EBFn \u0111\u1ED5i ng\u1EABu nhi\xEAn\r\n        + M\u1EB7t
    ph\u1EB3ng ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c: L\xE0 m\u1EB7t ph\u1EB3ng ch\u1EE9a vect\u01A1 E<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup>
    v\xE0 ph\u01B0\u01A1ng truy\u1EC1n s\xF3ng (z<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.4em>\u2192</size></sup>)\r\n\n-
    <color=red><b>Ph\xE2n lo\u1EA1i: </b></color>\n        + Ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c th\u1EB3ng:
    M\u1EB7t ph\u1EB3ng ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c c\u1ED1 \u0111\u1ECBnh khi s\xF3ng truy\u1EC1n
    lan\r\n                Ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c \u0111\u1EE9ng: E<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup>
    vu\xF4ng g\xF3c v\u1EDBi m\u1EB7t ph\u1EB3ng n\u1EB1m ngang (so v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t)\r\n               
    Ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c ngang: E<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup> song
    song v\u1EDBi m\u1EB7t ph\u1EB3ng n\u1EB1m ngang (so v\u1EDBi \u0111\u1EA5t)\r\n       
    + Ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c quay: M\u1EB7t ph\u1EB3ng ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c quay xung quanh
    tr\u1EE5c c\u1EE7a ph\u01B0\u01A1ng truy\u1EC1n s\xF3ng\r\n                Ph\xE2n
    c\u1EF1c tr\xF2n: Khi E<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup> quay
    v\u1EDBi bi\xEAn \u0111\u1ED9 kh\xF4ng \u0111\u1ED5i (V\u1EBD th\xE0nh m\u1ED9t
    \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng tr\xF2n)\r\n                Ph\xE2n c\u1EF1c elip: Khi E<sup><size=130%><voffset=0.5em>\u2192</size></sup>
    quay v\u1EDBi bi\xEAn \u0111\u1ED9 thay \u0111\u1ED5i t\u1EA1o th\xE0nh h\xECnh
    elip\r\n\r\nQuay ph\u1EA3i (RH): Thu\u1EADn chi\u1EC1u kim \u0111\u1ED3ng h\u1ED3\r\nQuay
    tr\xE1i (LH): Ng\u01B0\u1EE3c chi\u1EC1u kim \u0111\u1ED3ng h\u1ED3\r\n"
